---
<Prose title="Contact Enthusiast Review" h1="Contact Us" description="Email the Enthusiast Review hardware desk with corrections, spec changes, discontinued parts, BIOS issues or questions about a PC build. We read every message.">
  <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. We read every message.</p>
  <p>The most useful mail: a spec that changed, a part that went out of stock or was discontinued, a BIOS or compatibility problem we missed, or a build question one of our guides did not answer.</p>
  <p>We do not accept paid placements or sponsored reviews.</p>
</Prose>
